  "description": "The pure managed C# port of the Manifold geometry kernel, ported line for line from manifold-rust and bit-exact against it: booleans (union / difference / intersection), CSG trees, cross-sections, hulls, Minkowski sums, level sets and mesh repair, with both the exact engine and the robust engine that accepts real-world triangle soup. No native library, no P/Invoke, so it runs anywhere .NET does including browser-wasm.",
